### Optional: use with the "REST Client" extension in VS Code (humao.rest-client).
### Click "Send Request" above any request. Cookies are kept between requests automatically.
### Cloudflare's always-pass TEST captcha token is used below (see docs/SETUP_GUIDE.md).

@base = http://localhost:3000

### Health
GET {{base}}/api/health

### Developer roles (public)
GET {{base}}/api/developer-roles

### Register
POST {{base}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "alice@example.com",
  "password": "Passw0rdPassw0rd",
  "displayName": "Alice Example",
  "developerRole": "frontend_developer",
  "targetSeniority": "mid",
  "yearsOfExperience": 3,
  "captchaToken": "XXXX.DUMMY.TOKEN.XXXX"
}

### Login (after confirming the email)
POST {{base}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "alice@example.com",
  "password": "Passw0rdPassw0rd",
  "captchaToken": "XXXX.DUMMY.TOKEN.XXXX"
}

### My profile
GET {{base}}/api/me

### Update my profile
PATCH {{base}}/api/me
Content-Type: application/json

{ "displayName": "Alice Updated", "developerRole": "full_stack_developer", "targetSeniority": "senior", "yearsOfExperience": 4 }

### Try to promote myself (must fail with 400)
PATCH {{base}}/api/me
Content-Type: application/json

{ "accountType": "admin" }

### Logout
POST {{base}}/api/auth/logout

### Forgot password
POST {{base}}/api/auth/forgot-password
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "alice@example.com", "captchaToken": "XXXX.DUMMY.TOKEN.XXXX" }

### Reset password (only after clicking the emailed link, in the same browser session)
POST {{base}}/api/auth/reset-password
Content-Type: application/json

{ "password": "NewPassw0rd123" }

### ADMIN: list users (log in as an admin first)
GET {{base}}/api/admin/users?page=1&pageSize=20&search=alice

### ADMIN: promote / demote — replace USER_ID
PATCH {{base}}/api/admin/users/USER_ID/account-type
Content-Type: application/json

{ "accountType": "admin" }

### ADMIN: delete a user — replace USER_ID
DELETE {{base}}/api/admin/users/USER_ID

### ── Question bank (log in first) ─────────────────────────────────────────────
### Topic codes: javascript, typescript, react, nextjs, html_css, testing, performance,
### accessibility, frontend_architecture, design_systems, backend_awareness,
### frontend_system_design, collaboration, ownership, feedback_and_learning,
### prioritisation, problem_solving.   Domains: practice, behavioural, official.
GET {{base}}/api/questions?assessmentDomain=practice&topic=javascript&difficulty=easy

